# Agent bookkeeping: the issue-hunt watermark and the working-context
# checkpoint. This rule was only in .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone —
# so a fresh clone (a teammate, or a scheduled agent) saw these as untracked
# and could commit them. A tracked state file leaks the loop's bookkeeping
# into every PR, which is the accident the issue-hunt skill warns about.
.claude/pulseengine/
